# Always push and deploy

After finishing any code change the user asked for:

1. Create a git commit (follow the repo commit protocol).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`master` unless told otherwise).
3. Deploy on the Vultr VM:
   ```bash
   ssh root@155.138.175.82 "cd /opt/myuniassist && git pull && npm install && npm run build && systemctl restart myuniassist"
   ```
4. Confirm the site responds (e.g. `https://uniassist.app` returns 200).

Do this without waiting for another “push and deploy” request unless the user explicitly says not to deploy a specific change.
